  "reference": "2 Damanyoojiga 9",
  "verseCount": 31,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "9",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "2CH 9"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "9",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Bareanyeeka gatmooda was sugoocheanda bea ng'eanyiida Sheba",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iinea ghwayiiy gatmooda was sugoocheanda iita dagheerjeanduumeeda Sulemani, ghwahidu Yerusalemu gwasim aba ng'asheega hang'oonyi, nea goodeana fuga saang'a ea ngamiyajeega, nea gwasareeni geediga ng'andidi; ea lagheanga saang'a siguura dahaabu ea lagheanga haw sheayeat. Iinea ghwahidu heeda Sulemani, gwarukusa ng'asheega sean mideawa uhuudaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghwasha Sulemani ng'asheagaaschi sean, nea ea manda gida funyaat raay gwarukusa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean nea ghwadaah gatmooda was sugoocheanda dagheerjeanduumeeda Sulemani, ea geeda nideas, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ea hamichoojiga mida badayda measeadaanyi, ea giibinda fugaaschi hees, ea gidabiideata fugaaschi bea gadiyeeda, ea hang'weaka nyaawa, ea fuga sareeni gikoombeeydaanyi, ea hang'weaka nyaawa, ea haleanjeadaanyi bea wagiida sigwariida, adayiida aba jeeda gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA, ama ng'ata ghahamng'eanyi muuchi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeesha sugoocheanda, “Ng'asheesu ghayi eayiing'si ng'eanyiideanyu iin huumwa gil bea ng'asheagaagu ea weaghuumeadaang'u, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak ea maamwasi ea eeyi bwak ea dahidu dadeaksa geaw aba gheanyangeasu, ak ging'ulayi hawunda weaghuumeadaang'u giteena bugustaanyi miyeerukuneani; ang'iing'i gisuudi iita aayiinyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi dahoosana fugaagu, ak ea dahoosana fiisu ikaagu bea gadiyeedeani, fuga inyeesa gamiineadayi galeagasean aba madeadaang'u nea gooleeysiit weaghuumeadaang'u. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gagasa eebadiischeesa NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U, ninyeeda nihoosanyi ak ghwanung' apteadawana hoorgeadaanyi was sugoocheanda ak gigadiyeesi NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U! Aba gideaba ASEATAANG'U ghabwariiy Israeli ak gayghamiinda damanda manda muudeanooda, ak ea ghwanung' huwa sugoocheanda aba badahuuka nyaawa, ak gisin alooheeda ea doobiiwnata.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghoadaw sugoocheanda dalaantaji bughala ea diktam bea dahaabu, ea nagheega ng'andidi saang'a, ea lagheanga haw sheayeat; nea ea manda nagheega ng'andidi uurji suh adaw sugoocheanda was gatmoodean bea ng'eanyiida Sheba Sulemani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea gicha, fuga gadiyeeda bea Huramu ea gea Sulemani, was gea eana dahaabu ng'eanyiida Ofiri, gweadu geediga mareambiida ea lagheanga haw sheayeat. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwasin sugoocheanda aba geeta beehajeega jea eeding'deawa gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA ea gheeda sugoocheanda, ea gidoondoorajeega ea ginandajeega bea fuga sarmani; nea ea manda gea uurji suh aba ng'eanyiida Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghoadaw sugoocheanda was Sulemani haleanjeeda sean gaasa sugoocheanda was gatmooda bea Sheba, gilinyoo gagasa sean ea ghwanaawa gea ghayi eadu heeda sugoocheanda. Hean ghwayam geaw ak gabiikta ng'eanyiidaanyi, niny sea fugaaschi bea gadiyeeda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Meanang'oocheanduumeeda Sulemani",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea durumanata dahaabu siguura dahaabu siyeadu heeda Sulemani aba gwanyagi gaba dalaantaji bughalaji lah ea laadam ea lah, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "gea mawoosa gea eadu fuga sina fuga ageakshachi, ea sugoodiga Arabiya ea fuga ambal ng'eanyiida gweadu dahaabu ea lapiya heeda Sulemani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwasin Sulemani igeambooni bughalaji iyeenya hees, bea dahaabu was gea sigul; nea inyeesa jeemba igeamboonagi gaweay jeeda shekeelaji bughalaji lah bea dahaabooda sigul. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gabiikta gwasin igeambooni bughalaji samwagu bea dahaabooda sigul; nea inyeesa jeemba igeamboonagi gaweay jeeda shekeelaji bughalaji samwagu bea dahaabu siguura dahaabu was gea sigul; ng'ata ghwayiin sugoocheanda jeeda gheeda dareabeeta Lebanoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gabiikta gicha sugoocheanda gwasin hoorgeeda haw sisna gujaka beeshaka, ak ghoanoar aba dahaabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea hoorgeeda geegala geeshan lah, nea geeshanga apteadawa geesina dahaabu, sing'oosiinyi geat sea hoorgeeda, nea meatkwajeega sean bea hoorgeeda gwanda geatinga nea ghamiinaada ng'anyeew iyeenya aba murdajeega geatinga, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hean ghamiinaada ng'anyeew damaniyeenya aba hoowa, gaba nih miinaada aba hichpa geeshagi bea geeshan lah. Nea manda dea uurji nih sisindunu aba jeemba gheambalma nuut. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea haleanjeeda sean leehiida sugoocheanda was Sulemani geesina dahaabu, ea dabita sean bea gheeda dareabeeta Lebanoni gaba dahaabooda miyaas, nea lapiya ea meenung' ghoah gil aba damanda Sulemani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba maleambajeega sugoocheanda inyeesa gaweay Darshishi sea fuga gadiyeeda bea Huramu; inyeesa gaweay beadagi aba jeemba gweanyeew samwagu, nea iissa maleambajeega Darshishi ghapka nea gweadu dahaabu, ea lapiya, ea gujaka beeshaka, ea ghandajeega, ea dariidaka siguura dausi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghang'ataawa Sulemani sugoodiga suurja bea ng'eanyiida aba meanang'oocheanduumeeda ea weaghuumeeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak hean sugoodiga sean bea ng'eanyiida ghwaat geeshta Sulemani nea gagaseada ghwayiiy weaghuumeadaanyi, ghayi niyiin ASEETA uhuudaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gaba siisi eadu gidageatindaanyi, was haleanjeeda lapiya, ea gea dahaabu, ea hang'weaka, ea dabita ng'ucheeda, ea nagheega ng'andidi, ea faraasajeega, ea digeeniga saang'a gilakweayi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea Sulemani gwandeawa muhealuuti sagalamnyooji ang'wan bea faraasajeega ea mutukwajeega, ea fih sagalamnyooji damaniyeenya ding'da faraasajeega, was gea iin jeeda mujiinajeega mutukwajeega nea gwandeayi sea sugoocheanda aba Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghoahaaghwa sugoodiga suurja sean gidang'eada Furati ea gagul ng'eanyiida fuga Filisti, ea ghwahita moonghooda ng'eanyiida Misri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghwanung' sugoocheanda gawuurji lapiya lagheanga gealaan aba Yerusalemu, ea gubooyeeka ghwanung' ghoah meaghayga bea ng'eanyiida Shefela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata geeyeassa Sulemani faraasajeega siyeana Misri ea ng'eanyoojiga sean.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Giinuweasta gidambaliischeata Sulemani",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
