          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gadiyoojiga siipuut bea Sulemani, ng'eada gea madeeda ea gagul gea huuydean, meeng'oorsiina jeeda gitaabooda ng'asheega ning'ata bea sibaneeda siguura Natani, ea jeeda sibaneanduumeeda Ahiya was siida eemeeda Shiloni, ea jeeda giirgweatka Ido was siida ng'ushta aba badayda Yeroboamooda was orjeeda Nebati? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
